@* HelpCommentsPage: help topic "Comments and threads" at "/help/comments-and-threads". Static text and screenshots. *@
@page "/help/comments-and-threads"

<HelpTopicFrame Slug="comments-and-threads">
    <section class="card">
        <ul>
            <li>Click the <strong>+</strong> at a line to start a thread about that line. Hold Shift and click another
                line on the same side to comment on a range. To comment on the whole file instead, leave the line
                fields empty.</li>
            <li>Anyone signed in can <strong>reply</strong>, <strong>resolve</strong> a thread, and reopen it.
                Posted comments cannot be edited or deleted.</li>
            <li>The <strong>Link</strong> on a thread is a stable address of that thread. Press
                <strong>Copy link</strong> to copy it and paste it into a ticket; whoever opens it signs in if
                needed and lands on the same place.</li>
        </ul>
        <figure class="help-figure">
            <img class="help-shot" src="/help/comments-and-threads-1.png" loading="lazy"
                 alt="A comment thread under a line of the diff, showing the comment, the thread state, the Link and Copy link buttons, and the Reply and Resolve buttons." />
            <figcaption>A thread under the line it is about.</figcaption>
        </figure>
    </section>
</HelpTopicFrame>
